{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11108080","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11108080","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1110808001:0":{"text":"Oh, wow! You kids really know how to fight!","source_cn":"哦哦！你们几个娃子，战斗本领真不错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACC9523CDBC52C5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110808002:0":{"text":"Those thugs didn't stand a chance against you!","source_cn":"那群流沙之爪对你们完全造不成威胁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35936983825E7ED0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1110808002":{"text":"Those thugs didn't stand a chance against you!","source_cn":"那群流沙之爪对你们完全造不成威胁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35936983825E7ED0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110808003:1":{"text":"Did any caravans pass through here on their way to Alkali?","source_cn":"之前有没有商队经过这里，往咸水镇去？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA77D6C145C3C49DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110808004:1":{"text":"Yes, just a while ago! They were clinging to those metal coins like barnacles to a ship!","source_cn":"就在不久前！他们对金属小硬币的执着，比俺这牛脾气还倔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A018F66FC462B78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110808005:1":{"text":"No matter how hard I tried to reason with them, they wouldn't budge. They were dead set on doing business in Alkali!","source_cn":"不管俺怎么劝，他们都不听，非要去咸水镇做生意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78F409F91DD9552F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110808006:1":{"text":"Looks like the guy earlier was telling the truth. We should be able to catch up soon. ","source_cn":"嗯。之前那个商队的人没说谎。应该很快就能追上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x635FC8A0C9F0FC67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110808007:1":{"text":"Please let us through.","source_cn":"麻烦让路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC6522554A1D90A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110808008:1":{"text":"I trust you guys can handle yourselves! I'll remove the barricade right away.","source_cn":"你们，实力可以！俺这就把拒马收起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C207AA526410258","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110808009:1":{"text":"Though those Quicksand Claws ain't that strong, they're sneaky and there's a bunch of 'em. Like that attack 